1. model-verification.json - Model pinning check
2. fallback-verification.json - Fallback chain validation
3. cache-verification.json - Cache staleness detection
4. session-hygiene.json - Cross-session state checks
5. staleness.log - Cache check history
6. safety-report.md - Human-readable summary of issues",
